---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { legalName } from '../site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<Legal
  title="Copyright"
  description="Who owns the PetPomo artwork, code and characters, what you may do with them, and how to report infringement."
  updated="2026-08-16"
  intro="What you may do with the game's artwork and code, and how to report a problem."
>
  <h2>Ownership</h2>
  <p>
    © {year} {legalName}. The PetPomo name, the characters, the artwork, the sound design and the source code are
    owned by {legalName} unless credited otherwise below.
  </p>

  <h2>What you may do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Play the game, for free, as much as you like.</li>
    <li>Take screenshots and recordings, and post them anywhere — including monetised videos and streams.</li>
    <li>Link to the site, and quote short excerpts of the writing with attribution.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What you may not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Re-host the game, in whole or in part, on another domain.</li>
    <li>Extract the artwork, characters or sounds and use them in your own product.</li>
    <li>Sell merchandise using the characters or artwork.</li>
    <li>Present the game or its assets as your own work.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you want to do something not on either list, ask on <a href="/contact">the contact page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Third-party credits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Weather data from <a href="https://open-meteo.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Open-Meteo</a>,
      used under their free non-commercial terms.
    </li>
    <li>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Astro</a>,
      <a href="https://preactjs.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Preact</a>,
      <a href="https://threejs.org" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Three.js</a>,
      <a href="https://gsap.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">GSAP</a> and
      <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank">Tailwind CSS</a>, each
      under its own licence.
    </li>
    <li>Every sound effect is synthesized in the browser at runtime. No audio is sampled or licensed.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Reporting infringement</h2>
  <p>
    If you believe something on this site infringes your copyright, get in touch through
    <a href="/contact">the contact page</a> with:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>What you own, and evidence that you own it.</li>
    <li>The exact URL where it appears here.</li>
    <li>A way to reach you.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Anything that looks like a genuine claim will be taken down while it is investigated. If you find your work here
    and simply want credit rather than removal, say so — that is usually the easier fix for everyone.
  </p>
</Legal>
